# Force LF line endings for all text files across the repo.
# This overrides the machine-level `core.autocrlf=true` setting which
# would otherwise checkout git blobs as CRLF, ensuring `cargo fmt --check`
# and other tools see consistent Unix-style (LF) line endings regardless
# of the local git configuration. Matches `rustfmt.toml`'s
# `newline_style = "Unix"`.
* text=auto eol=lf